  "data": {
    "ruleType": "unit-ability",
    "group": "Emperor's Champion",
    "summary": "This ability has 2 parts:\n\n- When declaring a charge with an enemy **CHARACTER** unit no more than 12\" away from this unit, you may use this part. Doing so lets this unit re-roll the **Charge roll**, but its **charge move** must finish **engaged** with at least one such enemy **CHARACTER** unit.\n- Once per battle for your army, during the Fight phase, as this unit gets **selected to fight** while a **CHARACTER** unit is engaged with it, you may use this part. If you do, its melee attacks gain **[[DEVASTATING WOUNDS]](vsdata:weapon-ability/devastating-wounds)** for the rest of that phase.",
